  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rwandaro Coffee Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will sustain jobs for the 600 small holder farmers and improve standards of living for their families e.g improved housing, improved health care, access to quality education and improved nutrition. The project will also provide jobs to 9 full time staff that the cooperative directly employs. This project impacts positively the lives of 148 women who are part of the membership of the cooperative. Members incomes will increase due to the increased value of the coffee sold- both green bean and roast and ground coffee.</narrative>
  </description>
